e_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:source_review43-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"4j6_p4t_4k9","source_quote":"　　何求字子有，廬江灊人也。祖尚之，宋司空，父鑠，宜都太守。","reading":"何求祖尚之、父鑠各有官稱，卷中另敘二弟。","note":"何求祖尚之、父鑠各有官稱，卷中另敘二弟。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p043","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":30,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:source_review44-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"4j6_p4t_4k9","source_quote":"　　求元嘉末爲宋文帝挽郎，解褐著作郎，中軍衞軍行佐，太子舍人，平南參軍，撫軍主簿，太子洗馬，丹陽、吳郡丞。清退無嗜欲。又除征北參軍事，司徒主簿，太子中舍人。泰始中，妻亡，還吳葬舊墓，除中書郎，不拜。仍住吳，居波若寺，足不踰戶，人莫見其面。明帝崩，出奔國哀，除爲司空從事中郎，不就。乃除永嘉太守。求時寄住南澗寺，不肯詣臺，乞於寺拜受，見許。一夜忽乘小船逃歸吳，隱虎丘山，復除黃門郎，不就。永明四年，世祖以爲太中大夫，又不就。七年，卒。年五十六。","reading":"宋泰始中妻亡，明帝崩後出奔國哀。永明四年太中大夫，七年卒年五十六。","note":"宋泰始中妻亡，明帝崩後出奔國哀。永明四年太中大夫，七年卒年五十六。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p044","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":221,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:source_review45-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"4j6_p4t_4k9","source_quote":"　　初，求母王氏爲父所害，求兄弟以此無宦情。","reading":"王氏為何求母，父承上文何鑠。兄弟因母遇害無宦情。","note":"王氏為何求母，父承上文何鑠。兄弟因母遇害無宦情。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p045","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":22,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:variant_review45-4","kind":"variant_review","person_id":"4j6_p4t_4k9","source_quote":"求母王氏爲父所害","reading":"王氏是何求母；「父」承何求，兄弟名各有後文。","note":"王氏是何求母；「父」承何求，兄弟名各有後文。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p045","start_codepoint":4,"end_codepoin